%!PS-Adobe-3.0
%%Title: NL-N41 203 dpi 4x6 verification
%%Pages: 1
%%BoundingBox: 0 0 288 432
%%EndComments
<< /PageSize [288 432] >> setpagedevice
/Courier-Bold findfont 14 scalefont setfont
18 405 moveto (NL-N41 ARM64 TEST) show
/Courier findfont 9 scalefont setfont
18 387 moveto (4 x 6 inch / 203 dpi) show
18 371 moveto (TOP / no mirror / no negative) show
0 setgray 1 setlinewidth
18 18 moveto 270 18 lineto 270 350 lineto 18 350 lineto closepath stroke
18 330 moveto 118 330 lineto stroke
18 319 moveto (100 pt = 35.28 mm ruler) show
18 278 180 28 rectfill
18 266 moveto (Solid black: inspect white dots) show
% Alternating narrow and wide bars: an alignment pattern, not a shipping barcode.
0 1 39 { /i exch def /x 25 i 5 mul add def x 166 2 65 rectfill } for
18 151 moveto (Bars: inspect gaps and edges) show
18 130 moveto (Copies: print 2, count labels) show
18 110 moveto (LEFT) show
235 50 moveto (RIGHT) show
showpage
%%EOF
